  // THE ACCESSIBLE NAME  (AccName 1.2 §computation-steps · HTML-AAM · SVG-AAM)
  // ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  // What an element is CALLED. A screen reader says it aloud; an agent driving
